## Model card

- **Name:** MiniMax M3
- **Short description:** MiniMax M3 is described in local metadata as an open-weight large MoE model with 1M context for frontier coding and agent workloads.
- **Provider / access:** MiniMax platform/API and open-weights ecosystem (per local metadata). Local metadata lists `minimax-ai/minimax-m3` and `noFreeId`.
- **Release / knowledge:** Release and knowledge cutoff not independently verified from accessible official public sources in this pass.
- **IDs:** `minimax-m3`.
- **Context window:** 1,048,576 (1M) / 512K out (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text, image, video input; text output (local metadata).
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** Paid $0.30 / $1.20 per 1M (local metadata; promotional pricing noted).
- **Architecture:** 428B/23B-active MoE per local metadata; not independently verified in this pass.

